            "\\section{Dataset and Model Details}\n",
            "\\label{appendix:details}\n",
            "\\subsection{Validation Task set}\n",
            "Since \\citet{Wang2022BenchmarkingGV} do not provide an official split of the validation set, we present our own split here which is fixed across the experiments in the paper, Table \\ref{table:validset} show the categories of tasks in the validation set. We find the validation tasks with the principle that there are roughly equal numbers of classification and generation tasks. The exact task names can be found in the official website \\footnote{https://instructions.apps.allenai.org/}.\n",
